{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_title", "source_sha256": "a8b3073a41525b55f53a708cec442232451d3c76d9c941a8209433825299943a", "ja": "ロコモーション、リノベーション", "zh": "ROCO情绪、翻新", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2be10cf493f7b6249b228a486300a9d3f7225924987964d1405ea9ceb51c7707", "ja": "プロデューサーがロコの新曲を用意するが、\nロコと杏奈はゲームの事でケンカ中。レッス\nンが始まりメンバーと触れ合う中で、少しず\nつ素直になっていく。公演当日、ステージ袖\nには仲良くケンカするふたりの姿があった。", "zh": "制作人准备了ROCO的新歌，\n但ROCO和杏奈正因为游戏的事吵架中。\n随着课程开始，在与成员们的接触中，\n她们渐渐变得坦率起来。公演当天，舞台侧面\n出现了两个人吵吵闹闹、感情依旧很好的身影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c77937609d2b16db49609fa82779f647bc58238708653e9d0ab27497404ad82c", "ja": "（ロコのセンター公演に向けて、\n出演メンバー達のレッスンが始まった。が……）", "zh": "（为了ROCO的中心公演，\n出演成员们开始了练习。可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "94db7288181c0863d78a426889678fc517379a4e0c912e1f3b1b0b216ed15af2", "ja": "つまり、絶賛ケンカ中のロコちゃんと杏奈ちゃんの\nレッスンを、それとなくサポートすればいいのね？", "zh": "也就是说，只要若无其事地帮忙支持正在大吵架的ROCO和杏奈的训练就行了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3e81012ac814f2b2610b5d00a1b3a68ee8482c12ce654eeae4fe3498c6f4d4b1", "ja": "すみません、お願いします。これからどうしても\n外せない打ち合わせがあって……。", "zh": "不好意思，拜托你了。我接下来有个无论如何都不能缺席的会议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "e582fce51beb6037a72995107361dfe62272c3449ee23609eba527935952a690", "ja": "ふたりとも、目も合わせないから変だと思ってたのよ。\nウフフ、{$P$}も大変ね。", "zh": "你们两个连眼神都不交汇，我就觉得很奇怪了。嘻嘻，{$P$}也很辛苦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "078e086d6351cf6e676ea03b88144cdc22e40b74d4724a82d911f1fb0453e545", "ja": "もちろん構わないわよ。\n今日のレッスンは、お姉さんに任せなさい！", "zh": "当然没问题啦。\n今天的练习就包在大姐姐身上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d1e312e09e484a3afc9ad12e0d84289c4193a7ee60914c3691998425142b631b", "ja": "すみません！　ではしばらく、お願いします！\n暗くなる前には、劇場に戻ってきますので！", "zh": "不好意思！那接下来暂时就拜托你了！\n我会在天黑之前回到剧场的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "435c28879b402284a5a0656406c828b5356bde66fbf988ad4bcab19260894c68", "ja": "どうしてよ～！　ここの振りは手の動きをおもいっきり\n見せた方が、盛り上がるに決まってるじゃない！", "zh": "为什么呀～！这里的舞蹈动作当然是把手部动作尽情展现出来，气氛才会更热烈嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "c23ab58c3fb26bfe1357e91b1c2c1738542b869232c4bd67b36a8f8ec95c0496", "ja": "そんなことないってば！　動きは抑えて、しっかり\nタメを作ったほうが、絶対映えると思うな！", "zh": "才不是那样呢！我觉得动作收敛一些，好好地蓄力之后，绝对会更出彩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "a12ab17f15ac3e810b2b0f16aa96a8eb428a6619455d78bfdc64fde1627ede14", "ja": "ふ、ふたりともストップ、ストップしてください～！\nここはクールに……ううっ、へ、ヘルプです～……。", "zh": "两、两位都停下，停一下啦～！\n这里要冷静地……呜呜，救、救命啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "0ccf4efd5e3602073256b9215d86f4907f496798ec5af300e7d519cb0e51231d", "ja": "あ、あの……、んと……っ。", "zh": "那、那个……嗯……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "f6fdb6c296ce2725d89c0c58be3cf1277cbac959a8576f9450c3c29ebc3bab20", "ja": "あんたの得意なダンスの見せどころでしょ？　もっと\n大胆に行きなさいよね。それとも、自信ないのかしら？", "zh": "这可是展现你拿手舞蹈的机会吧？再表现得\n大胆一点嘛。还是说，你没有自信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "42ff43a641e652af6d3551777d2710cd34357a37ebc4ddc29cea15b9cb484fe0", "ja": "伊織こそ、苦手なとこ大振りで乗り切ろうと\nしてるよね？　勢いだけじゃダメだと思うよっ！", "zh": "伊织才是在不擅长的地方想靠大动作蒙混过关吧？光靠气势可不行哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "76d380937f7c85c91cbf14dddbc16a2c798bff4a0e315500e8c9831501a0eebe", "ja": "あら、伊織ちゃんと真ちゃんまでケンカ？\nしょうがないわね～。はいはい、そこまでよ！", "zh": "哎呀，连伊织和真也吵起架来了？\n真拿你们没办法呀～。好啦好啦，到此为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "0ad7a345ed81a932a3864872bae69b5bcced0b8d95c19b29a92ef0739a2391b5", "ja": "あ……すみません、このみ師匠。熱くなり過ぎました。\n……いや、ケンカのつもりはなかったんですけど……。", "zh": "啊……对不起，这野师父。是我太激动了。\n……不，我没打算吵架，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "75d5019e6c4d10b2047f1e33ff17e705830cf3941ad986385ea13d2de4b40a97", "ja": "そうよ、今のは別に……\nミーティングみたいなものよ。", "zh": "没错，刚才那也没什么……\n就像是开会一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "f3b2fa24f49376b4f74fae547bd4b9af96b9e01b4599983e008a42e8606ac6d5", "ja": "そう、さすがね♪　それじゃ、もう少し静かに\n話し合ってもらえると、お姉さんも安心かな？", "zh": "没错，不愧是你♪ 那么，要是能再安静一点讨论，姐姐也就放心了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "35c07781fc5bc553c720047bf8079d4d660befb649f806209de503b74034b00d", "ja": "……そうね、そうするわ。とりあえず、いったん休憩に\nしましょ。……ねえ杏奈、この間のゲーム持ってない？", "zh": "……也是呢，就这么办吧。总之先休息一下\n吧。……我说杏奈，前阵子那个游戏你带了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "cfe3c0b716f2f94f10070ce7735b73d1a70491980d076ce8057023105bca9fe7", "ja": "え？　この間の……サンドボックス？", "zh": "诶？之前那个……沙盒游戏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "2a23543ecb5bd81e264415dee8b6e51646501204283a6c0625e528d7f9b1df82", "ja": "そう、気分転換によさそうじゃない？　結局、狩りを\nするのと何か作るの、どっちがいいことになったの？", "zh": "对，感觉挺适合换换心情的，不是吗？所以最后决定是去狩猎，还是做点什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "a5c9e0ca93ed2427ade87e14900a17c2518b8324ddba2378bd28ce405312ea84", "ja": "そ、それはですね……まだ、ディスカッションが\nできてなくて～……。", "zh": "那、那个嘛……还没来得及讨论呢～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "72be99a66b818147eaaf3a9e393b152cbc8d3b96ba4486fb21739332758209ff", "ja": "あら、まだケンカしてたの？\nもう、しょうがないわね～。", "zh": "哎呀，还在吵架呢？\n真是的，拿你们没办法呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "7c5315f3f66f0dc8ad4d13d805063853d7334f7eb37550e1981805902a1a654a", "ja": "え、ロコと杏奈ってケンカしてたの！？\n全然話さないから、おかしいとは思ってたけど……？", "zh": "诶，ROCO和杏奈吵架了！？  \n因为你们完全不说话，我就觉得有点奇怪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "33b22c7f16f8486afca0f25e756e0d374256358e847f367ee92afcb2db6bc9f1", "ja": "別に……ケンカじゃ、ないです……。", "zh": "没什么……不是在吵架……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "ec1e112c61c16115e06c9c0c26946181dec4177dd489e585c46d6db8a15448fe", "ja": "そ、そうです！　ロコとアンナは、ちょっとポリシーが\nコンフリクトしただけです。それで、その……。", "zh": "对、对！ROCO和安娜，只是理念有点冲突而已。所以，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "f06e8aea330971fefc4e62dfc9ef17edb7e363c2384ae135ef3f3d0a61599812", "ja": "こんふり……えっと、意見の衝突、みたいな？\nうんうん、あるよね～そういうこと！", "zh": "冲突……呃，就是意见不合之类的？\n嗯嗯，这种事确实常有呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "1b0aa417a0baf1549149ca2bf731c60ec391acccc9b8d648ddb7281131056343", "ja": "そうね、真とは特によくあるわね。\n早く伊織ちゃんのセンスに追いつきなさい♪", "zh": "是啊，我和真之间尤其经常发生这种事呢。\n你要快点跟上伊织的品味才行哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "02012e37066fa74b541f2f3263f2ebb7cb929d8815598f139c00b35311bd1c67", "ja": "むっ。伊織こそ、ボクの素直さを\n少しは見ならってよね！　ふーんだ！", "zh": "哼。伊织才是，多少也该学学我的坦率吧！哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "3253d0252852d7fe22913fe9b1d8035516230db66e7011d9ee1b4a9aa75259d2", "ja": "さて！　一息入れたところで。ここからは、\n今度の公演のセットリストを相談しましょう！", "zh": "那么！休息了一下。接下来商量一下这次公演的演出曲目吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "89e62c0b2bc41c3e8a9b38e81a8d44abb485157da98cfea664f75c467c3bc562", "ja": "うーん、せっかくのお披露目だし、ロコの新曲は\n盛り上がってるところに入れたいよね。", "zh": "嗯——难得有这样的首次亮相，还是把ROCO的新歌安排在气氛正热烈的时候比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1031_007ior", "source_sha256": "521799066f8e94cfdace19e34de9ab47f1be954b4535bc8973e1f934b50da4db", "ja": "そうね～。ここ、私たちのMC明けはどうかしら？\nタイミングバッチリじゃない？", "zh": "对呀～。要不要安排在我们主持环节结束之后？\n这个时机不是刚刚好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "cd4c2882d866e8e3d3647bd06f1606aee50a1b2196a92f806e03dc8003703e0a", "ja": "そっか、曲の流れ的にも……うん、ボクたちのMCで\n会場をあっためて、バッチリつなげると思う！", "zh": "这样啊，从歌曲流程来说……嗯，用我们的MC先让现场热起来，应该就能衔接得恰到好处！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1033_007ior", "source_sha256": "407055872a385610e1b4e999622b9739ac1598cf7610c99e7075db1e4e12d489", "ja": "決まりね！　この伊織ちゃんの可愛いトークに、\nしっかりついて来なさいっ。にひひっ♪", "zh": "就这么定了！可要好好跟上伊织的可爱聊天哦。嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "4064ecc9b0ae3816d8ce547a203a6f7ba614118ba880e7edd8485099d76938a7", "ja": "それじゃあ、曲順はこうして……うん、よさそうね！\nロコちゃんと杏奈ちゃんはどう思う？", "zh": "那么，曲目顺序就这样安排……嗯，应该不错！\nROCO和杏奈，你们觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "8e8920e2323479c9a9f3bb5eb539595ffb4deca4d0662eb1559e09dec81b55c3", "ja": "？　どうしたの、二人とも？", "zh": "？怎么了，你们两个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1037_025roc", "source_sha256": "5f3c2d07ea722d326cca6f1b9d9a5e94b15ff686a366734d0145e7a9175226fe", "ja": "あ、あの……。結局、マコトとイオリは……、\nケンカしてないんですか？", "zh": "啊，那个……结果真和真、伊织……没有吵架吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1038_006mak", "source_sha256": "cf784dc8488275797d57732539b88ede2514867c53e9f09c9da31fe5111a0ae5", "ja": "は？", "zh": "啥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1039_007ior", "source_sha256": "cf784dc8488275797d57732539b88ede2514867c53e9f09c9da31fe5111a0ae5", "ja": "は？", "zh": "啥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1040_024ann", "source_sha256": "a076ce9ba2f85426d99088b8bf229143dcc7d12ec6ca27d48e5c4bda265f4427", "ja": "レッスンの時、ふたりとも……怒ってたから……。", "zh": "练习的时候，你们两个人……都在生气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1041_006mak", "source_sha256": "63f9281d1887e0fcca0d14fd5e172bfb20e0d090c2df8f0813ecc48202895668", "ja": "ああ、あれか。ごめんね、驚かせちゃって。\n熱くはなってたけど、ホントにケンカじゃないんだ。", "zh": "啊，你说那次啊。对不起，吓到你了。\n虽然当时确实有点激动，但真的不是在吵架。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1042_007ior", "source_sha256": "b80373dc789a24600e297b560e2c48820c4bad57f40c911f3bfc5b4422598949", "ja": "ミーティングって言ったでしょ？\nあれくらい、いつものことだし。それに……。", "zh": "我说过那是开会吧？\n那种程度的争论，平时也很常见。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1043_007ior", "source_sha256": "ad0ede050d2144976bb6922a8aa41227d3b2fc62d177c683e4751e2439a597a3", "ja": "言いたいことは、ガマンするのもされるのも、\nイヤなの。……それだけよ。", "zh": "不管是憋着自己想说的话，还是让别人憋着，\n我都不喜欢。……就这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1045_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1046_p", "source_sha256": "7afbbb96b5730ace3c8bcc88f107beced26deb68386e7802b0698e4f14f16977", "ja": "（ふぅ、やっと一段落ついた。\nさて、ロコ達のレッスンは……うん？）", "zh": "（呼，终于告一段落了。好了，ROCO们的训练……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1047_025roc", "source_sha256": "7e740f6f54fd09d258dadbedb1d0102bafc8a436e989f1d24e636371f863db5d", "ja": "あの、コノミ……。時間ありますか？\nその……少し、聞きたいことがあるんですけど……。", "zh": "那个，木实……你现在有时间吗？\n那个……我有点事情想问问你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1048_039kon", "source_sha256": "a23dd1c33ab52be4a2debde834ab81d6aa87d592a152bd1f84e4eaf81c91beb6", "ja": "お姉さんに相談事？　お安い御用……あ。\nちょうどもう一人、相談相手が帰って来たみたい。", "zh": "来找姐姐商量事情？小事一桩……啊。\n正好又回来了一位可以商量的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1049_p", "source_sha256": "f74bcdc736f2059f2a06678fe42604a8331329ee58b96aaaa4cb9eaf0d6ea20b", "ja": "……今日はありがとうございました、このみさん。\nロコ、できれば俺にも聞かせてくれるか？", "zh": "……今天谢谢你了，木实小姐。\nROCO，可以的话，也让我听听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1050_025roc", "source_sha256": "f2392296868b72115295010c8f2c80c824e8ee66069460757e1250ce74354192", "ja": "{$P$}……。もちろん、コンサルして\nくれていいというか、してほしいというか～……。", "zh": "{$P$}……。当然可以来找我商量，或者说，我希望你来找我商量～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1051_039kon", "source_sha256": "8f233edf5f20a0b0285c9604dd50240faa96b01b5b1d77af442f181554000b1a", "ja": "杏奈ちゃんのことよね？\n仲直りしたい？", "zh": "是指杏奈吧？\n想和她和好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1052_025roc", "source_sha256": "0d90661e3efea6e0b1154d29398e203926dd55e9bbde05a1ecc02cd323316e41", "ja": "ど、どうしてそうなるんですか！？\nロコはまだ、何も言ってませんよ！？", "zh": "为、为什么会变成这样啊！？\nROCO还什么都没说呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1053_039kon", "source_sha256": "8f40648be2aca7089c0c832b9b39e4158195d170d8faf8d1635d71aa40ff8b66", "ja": "ロコちゃんの顔が言ってるの！\nそれとも、仲直りしたくない？", "zh": "ROCO的脸上都写着呢！\n还是说，不想和好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1054_025roc", "source_sha256": "23f4998ff762ac1b53f5799ce88e6e5b81cb23ffc7a1f97a3e9acd6c3c7b27d4", "ja": "い、いえ、仲直りしたいです……アンナと……。\nでも……、どうすればいいのか……。", "zh": "不、不是的，我想和好……和杏奈……\n可是……我不知道该怎么做才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1055_p", "source_sha256": "23fd64070a4e86db387c073b0cef318b0810f9b305e8f83495940d098bf9b3ba", "ja": "……よかった、安心したよ。\nそれじゃ、ロコはもう杏奈に怒ってないんだな？", "zh": "……太好了，这下我就放心了。\n那么，ROCO已经不生杏奈的气了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1056_025roc", "source_sha256": "343690bdb16f909599404f9c646f84e6959f72ebdde6c7a68c15a68a62fb2642", "ja": "もちろんです。……ロコは最初から、\nアンナに怒ってたんじゃなくて……、ただ……。", "zh": "当然了。……ROCO从一开始就，\n并不是在生杏奈的气……只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1057_025roc", "source_sha256": "4fab3c95771eb6d4fbedaa42a0b8ec4ab0a9a842400309f0e587829d871542f1", "ja": "せっかく、アンナと一緒に楽しめるものができたのに、\nアンナに違うっていわれるのが……イヤだったの……。", "zh": "好不容易做出了能和杏奈一起享受的东西，却被杏奈说不对……我不想那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1058_p", "source_sha256": "0aaeefb6bef563e3163a0625725071b0215b5ba85c1831811a4ff536fd62a2c1", "ja": "……違うっていった杏奈じゃなくて、\n違うことになるのがイヤ……だったのか。なるほどな。", "zh": "……讨厌的不是说出不同意见的杏奈，\n而是变成意见不同这件事……是这样吗。原来如此啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1059_039kon", "source_sha256": "d74b3f8d70d463fb20fcd564842bbdf6fcedb2c556e0db2cd004281275738f3b", "ja": "ちょっと寂しくなっちゃったのね、ロコちゃん……。", "zh": "稍微感到寂寞了呢，ROCO。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1060_025roc", "source_sha256": "51418f1a8a02d98f7ee81090552d55fceb9c081b14c5f5345ec82d55a5f97212", "ja": "でも……ターゲットが同じでも、アプロ―チが違うのは\n普通のことです。むしろ、いいことなんです。", "zh": "但是……即使目标相同，采取不同的方法也是很正常的。倒不如说，这是件好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1061_025roc", "source_sha256": "7fd03668ce8f9c28581c3a2ecfb0770f27064f5090d75beecbed7bd525eceece", "ja": "だって、ロコはロコですし、アンナはアンナです！\n違って当たり前で、違うほうがイノベーティブで……。", "zh": "因为，ROCO就是ROCO，安娜就是安娜！不同才是理所当然，而且与众不同才更有创新性……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1062_025roc", "source_sha256": "238450f8ad2a89d369e4ef348e27a04c4659af171761c59f0abe22f3f23c35ba", "ja": "それって、ロコが……\nずっと一番、大事にしてたことなのに……。", "zh": "那明明是……ROCO一直以来最珍视的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1063_p", "source_sha256": "d391aa389849064384a67fccd84a18184216866321c8be9a361962ef3fe2647f", "ja": "……大丈夫。そういうことなら、\n杏奈とはきっと、すぐ仲直りできる。", "zh": "……没关系。既然是这样，肯定很快就能和杏奈和好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1064_025roc", "source_sha256": "17b7fe0ce692dce3bb3d30627d111bec112686a7965f0e9ec7f2a7961b4a693a", "ja": "えっ？　どうしてですか？", "zh": "咦？为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1065_p", "source_sha256": "68ff83aa8b6a1bba5e9deef2d73b568da79d6912a49ec08f841c5a966ada6369", "ja": "ロコは、違いを大事にする気持ちを思い出したんだ。\n他人を認められる人は、ちゃんと認めてもらえるよ。", "zh": "ROCO想起了珍视差异的心情。\n能够认可他人的人，也一定会得到他人的认可。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1066_p", "source_sha256": "705fae57dc66374f51b31055c46af1c3900e8c578d49791e9c7aee37afeb6ccf", "ja": "それってつまり、信頼関係ってことだから。\n杏奈が嫌がるとは思えないな。", "zh": "也就是说，这就是信任关系。  \n我觉得杏奈应该不会讨厌吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1068_025roc", "source_sha256": "a663bbd0e11738d5b2ecd36e375acdd2fa57d734ce1e27e8302823236e59a301", "ja": "あの……サンクスです。ロコは……\nロコはちょっと、アンナを探しに行ってきます！", "zh": "那个……谢谢。至于ROCO……  \nROCO的话，我先去找一下安娜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1069_039kon", "source_sha256": "78f6d1569223cb76c109920782cba99d01df2302501ae07ec2b3da1e4f80fcdb", "ja": "それがいいわね。きっと……杏奈ちゃんも、\n同じ気持ちだから。ね、{$P$}？", "zh": "那样最好呢。安娜一定也是同样的心情。对吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1070_p", "source_sha256": "f15ff9a8d0cab19932d07bd38bafec1c590056a7aa8736de427f3096c7da7e7c", "ja": "そうですね。ロコ、杏奈はさっき近くにいたから、\n遠くまで行かなくていいからな？", "zh": "是啊。ROCO，杏奈刚才就在附近，不用跑太远，明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1071_025roc", "source_sha256": "bae9c5584e776a52405e100b53beebb20ea0c328147d32a6cc4c8fe3fe2c328f", "ja": "え？　は、はい、わかりました！\nとにかく行ってきます～！", "zh": "诶？好、好的，我知道了！\n总之我先过去啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1072_p", "source_sha256": "1c2be96e080f24865ed063a6bd0d412376cf532783c10b438e99a0f9cc6bf203", "ja": "……杏奈、いいのか？\nロコが探しに行っちゃったけど。", "zh": "……杏奈，这样好吗？\n虽然ROCO已经去找了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_074_1073_024ann", "source_sha256": "f96fbb56fe6e63011fa5f8b302ea2e1e03f4ea0a4c692e3c063f971a521324bc", "ja": "んと……。{$P$}さん、\nこのみさんも……知ってた、の？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生，连好美姐也……知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
